github.tarball_from archive
revision            1
categories          multimedia python
license             GPL-3
maintainers         {gmail.com:audvare @Tatsh} openmaintainer
description         Software defined VHS decoder.
long_description    vhs-decode decodes raw RF captures of VHS, Betamax, Video8 and other analogue \
                    tape formats (and, as ld-decode, of LaserDiscs) into TBC files, and \
                    hifi-decode decodes their HiFi audio. The TBC tools that process the output \
                    are in the tbc-tools port.

